# Playgrounds

Maps: `playgrounds/README.md`, `playgrounds/nuxt/README.md`, `playgrounds/vue/README.md`.

- Do not implement library components here. Show them through the adapter with no manual component import.
- Nuxt: `modules: ['@achareh/ui']`; `UApp` wraps `NuxtPage` in `app/app.vue`.
- Vue: `plugins: [vue(), ui(...)]` in that order, plus `app.use(ui)` in `src/main.ts`. Both steps stay. `UApp` wraps `src/App.vue`.
- CSS is `@import "tailwindcss"` then `@import "@achareh/ui"`. Color overrides live in the same `@theme` block in both apps, not in `app.config`.
- Dark mode is the `dark` class on `documentElement`. Direction comes from `UApp` (`rtl` by default); the HTML root is `lang="fa" dir="rtl"` in both.
- A UI example lands in both playgrounds.
